      "text": "those who desire to alter law to establish king over land are called king-men, Alma 51:5. refuse to defend country, Alma 51:13. are slain by army of Moroni1 or cast into prison, Alma 51:17–19 (60:16). are compelled to defend country, Alma 51:20–21. prevent Nephites from dispersing enemies, Alma 60:16. receive trial and are executed, Alma 62:9.",
